{
  "name": "Elemental Defense: Flesh of Stone",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you gain access to this element, as a Bonus Action, you can harden your body like stone, dampening the impact of most attacks until you dismiss the effect (no action required).</p><p>While the effect is active and you aren't wearing any armor or shield, your AC equals 10 + your Constitution modifier + your Charisma modifier and any bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing you take is reduced by an amount equal to half your kineticist level (rounded down), this reduction applies before any other effect.</p><p>This effect is exclusive with Elemental Defense class features from other Elemental Schools.</p>",
